==Problem 24==
A ship travels from point A to point <imath>B</imath> along a semicircular path, centered at Island <imath>X</imath>. Then it travels along a straight path from B to <imath>C</imath>. Which of these graphs best shows the ship's distance from Island <imath>X</imath> as it moves along its course?

<asy>size(150);
pair X=origin, A=(-5,0), B=(5,0), C=(0,5);
draw(Arc(X, 5, 180, 360)^^B--C);
dot(X);
label("$X$", X, NE);
label("$C$", C, N);
label("$B$", B, E);
label("$A$", A, W);
</asy>

<center>
